#: scenario4:scenario4_888D00E4_5DDF_4A0F_AC21_3C76072CE6C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39e2d2bbb8c757d992190a75898117dfa555bfcae171942196a07e0cd025842f
