msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Hehehe..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Héhéhé..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_30E5E1BB_B7F2_4FAF_BA5D_69954D3BD547
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ceb5c72c55d483e7fa42c6e43dcd729b118607dda5534754fe72fc1ae56bff1c
#. default-sha256: c41bbc1d3012af3592dda346b3a8f5827de120d846d2cd23a37f760e652c8f73
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_30E5E1BB_B7F2_4FAF_BA5D_69954D3BD547"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You know now who you are, do you not?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You remember everything now, do you "
"not?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Vous savez à présent qui vous êtes, n’est-ce pas ?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Vous vous souvenez de "
"tout maintenant, non ?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_B194619B_C01B_4ED1_A384_43CC74CC0CBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14d17ddb9e0deee900c6099c2ef9f243956ba7f7eec2f6699b17cd6d8e32e1d0
#. default-sha256: a18877f8dec6ce38922abbb70b5edb8bf6b7b38378ab179e18613b1a5e04fde5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B194619B_C01B_4ED1_A384_43CC74CC0CBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You were present in every single era.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The reason for which is as I described in the "
"previous tale:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vous étiez présente dans chacune de ces époques.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La raison qui l’explique est, "
"comme je vous l’ai dit dans le précédent conte,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_74CD1C8A_A4D5_41B2_9FA0_8BACE6033A72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36e2fd2a6e3b9735102fe2fddacef8aece0596b771d4661dfd525faf4287e09c
#. default-sha256: 4b789e000d12106b9ff6b8e8357adfe6b6a1b1e49214be2c1df417aff045d927
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_74CD1C8A_A4D5_41B2_9FA0_8BACE6033A72"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫because you yearned to be reunited with someone.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But that person never showed up—"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫in any era."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫parce que vous désiriez être réunie avec quelqu’un.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mais cette personne ne s’est "
"jamais présentée—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ quelle que soit l’époque."

#: scenario4:scenario4_AF0F7A7E_BAC4_4A40_9E07_65C1528B46FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ee0bfe2964411f9f346324fa174e21a3e4ff1bfd507d14fcf56e4ef38800c5c
#. default-sha256: d230c7e0520477f1dfd33f85f21d9139d4fb1c6ea261a0666d2a99d9366d890a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AF0F7A7E_BAC4_4A40_9E07_65C1528B46FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And poor, sweet you, having no memory of any of that..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Et vous, pauvre petite chose, qui n’avez aucun souvenir de tout cela..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E428239F_CEA7_4A3E_8AC2_7DB486476010
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f61e71a965b41189307755a135f43f8a428329d1ee64aa66145f5254835e777f
#. default-sha256: 7e92d181a2fdad4d9f267b6191bc04ed1b528a74a8c9635d7b9aa719b2258e38
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E428239F_CEA7_4A3E_8AC2_7DB486476010"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫lived those lives with other men."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...vous viviez ces vies avec d’autres hommes."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6D4DC32D_2721_4440_ACF6_FDC1CD804679
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5da965cc39bd9ff7ecccc17958de58f4cc037edaad28b5136ff1fdd0e706836e
#. default-sha256: e312ad3443543c2ab96140c0271fc9b83c59d52e17154a62ac0b9f138f4b3ee0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6D4DC32D_2721_4440_ACF6_FDC1CD804679"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Is it any surprise misfortune befell those eras, then?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Est-ce un hasard si le malheur vous poursuivait, dans ce cas ?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7184B801_A9A2_4A5A_825E_52C1CB605614
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d04beeeaf754f544a300cd5a9f30c4561521d4717862309ac06a7ea008c00bc8
#. default-sha256: b5aa157b3061c0150ea3986cf091a025601cfaae5fe38278c5bb5b8615f576a5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7184B801_A9A2_4A5A_825E_52C1CB605614"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The door swung closed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La porte se referma."

#: scenario4:scenario4_93E5634F_9071_481C_80D5_5D5B3D1A7903
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64ed569636b5d74fd653bd929742158d50dae8a61a7a73266714509651c1259f
#. default-sha256: 38c1f044b2635bae86df83439f63ea95a86ec8cca92280b3afd9bad1772f125b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_93E5634F_9071_481C_80D5_5D5B3D1A7903"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But rather than outside, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ and the Maid were inside the dull, "
"monochrome room at the top of the observation tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais au lieu d’être à l’extérieur, la Servante et ⟪k:1⟫vous êtes⟪k:2⟫la Défunte sont⟪k:3⟫ à "
"l’intérieur de la pièce terne et grise, au sommet de la tour d’observation."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E4A94C21_3189_4168_A05B_E2C567BCADA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bc8ced3d5f2df24df9fa244d86ee93e63681c1141f2083df00fc48b2cb8dc61
#. default-sha256: e87f29b8f67c639964072c6e5cfe64af1ef0673c496a9cf673ac6a571b069517
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E4A94C21_3189_4168_A05B_E2C567BCADA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The awe-inspiring ray of light shone not through the lone window high upon the stone wall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’impressionnant rayon de lumière ne brille plus à travers la lucarne, en haut du mur de "
"pierre."

#: scenario4:scenario4_9AD4ACE6_C165_4387_AB8B_965A367809DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ed708a5252d97476cea5ef8bf75e50760a1f8109eb2f5f51f575aecf8d1fc91
#. default-sha256: 873d342d3ac5bfe40c300f6bdd4d8f61ff5021295c97ebe4b9ead0e26e10e894
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9AD4ACE6_C165_4387_AB8B_965A367809DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Wrapped in a curious, impenetrable darkness, ⟪k:1⟫You both⟪k:2⟫they⟪k:3⟫ stood alone in the "
"room."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Entourées de cette obscurité inquisitrice, impénétrable, ⟪k:1⟫vous vous tenez toutes les "
"deux, seules,⟪k:2⟫elles se tiennent toutes les deux, seules,⟪k:3⟫ dans la pièce."

#: scenario4:scenario4_08082BEE_BF0F_49B8_B391_FFAFBAF0D488
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d917998ed185d4de0779c19c372b95ce707a33ec87729887e9c7cfb302c449eb
#. default-sha256: e03288d5755780172fcd9d80a3fa83295f7ef2a742a5925d92fd2f24cd2e3987
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_08082BEE_BF0F_49B8_B391_FFAFBAF0D488"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The Maid wore a gentle, but brittlely cold smile as she looked straight at ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫"
"him⟪k:3⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Servante arbore un sourire doux mais amèrement froid tout en ⟪k:1⟫vous regardant⟪k:2⟫la "
"regardant⟪k:3⟫."

#: scenario4:scenario4_59DA248B_53B8_46EA_97ED_41E3205E4794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b8a6942fdb81bcc0e345c34675787f5a80d430df3ca9dc5fc14d4371a971053
#. default-sha256: 20b5bb89732fae213badb1f81969c494f154c9077b6e4dd45cfdbf6726f3f225
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_59DA248B_53B8_46EA_97ED_41E3205E4794"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It is not your fault misfortune befell you.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The only force to blame for that "
"is fate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ce n’est pas de votre faute si le malheur s’est abattu sur vous.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫L’unique "
"force à blâmer est le destin."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D698B4F1_1523_47BA_BDE8_52FD24FF397F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4fcb7b3d1d14d4df027b011e8aaa3c9fc52cc9e08da89e6874b0311f25b80d5
#. default-sha256: ac6fe75e887a57cd7385dcee58dd1741e8f96b6b2d69ee108500ba25aaf19805
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D698B4F1_1523_47BA_BDE8_52FD24FF397F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You were always so kind, so pure of heart.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You had boundless trust for others and "
"the goodness of people."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vous avez toujours été si gentille, si pure de cœur.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Vous avez témoigné une "
"confiance inébranlable envers les autres, vous avez cru à leur bonté."

#: scenario4:scenario4_43F9E646_DBDF_49D5_B6CA_BB446B46B564
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fbf4217cb9acf6efd8944a069d307879edd79a9082d54d795a1f58cdd76ab1d0
#. default-sha256: ad018d5afb5b4877820ee4956199c090c9c7819256867072343bf29c56019c1c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_43F9E646_DBDF_49D5_B6CA_BB446B46B564"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You were the very image of all that is right."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vous étiez l’image même de tout ce qui représente le bien."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7DF46AD4_9E5C_41C1_82A9_9EB6AD8E4082
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4af9729e381cddc6210ef87dac4b07adead5132b9d94b0725b9a1e22d37a35da
#. default-sha256: ca6cbba13f357afceebd3733bcc7b68c40c2d1f0af1b5e65f31a3b36fb7bbb18
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7DF46AD4_9E5C_41C1_82A9_9EB6AD8E4082"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There is no greater misfortune⟪k:2⟫than someone as pure and beautiful as you..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il n’y a pas de plus grand malheur que de voir quelqu’un comme vous, de beau et de "
"pur..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FCEF73D5_C5F0_4551_8C80_48C163A936CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bf40f4e552a74543ed6e00b533017a3fbcbf1961179f3e626c90038d45f579a
#. default-sha256: 3f5ff6492d0ec29b6519e1b244e964d170eddf8dd633ff77f9f9e0d3eb7d5aca
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FCEF73D5_C5F0_4551_8C80_48C163A936CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫being mercilessly thrown into the grinding gears of tragedy again and again."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫être jeté sans pitié dans les engrenages de la tragédie, pour y être broyé encore et encore."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8DB36CD3_1590_4FC9_9E01_681A33745D42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b274d344e580f844bbedf96c513c70f209e57ec38f627b1a03e991c6915bb53c
#. default-sha256: 6f6e3a74b12cb67cc07d3e47b6095ec0573e50c378d6ab4f31993693600fb7f9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8DB36CD3_1590_4FC9_9E01_681A33745D42"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I still pity you for everything you had to go through.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You poor, poor soul..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Maintenant encore, j’ai pitié de vous pour tout ce que vous avez dû endurer.⟪k:2⟫ "
"Pauvre, pauvre âme..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_067B98EE_A44C_4082_9288_94B79A32DC58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb366353560e80b199e0834e32b7661d137daa4df6729c3ea345848a5cfda0f6
#. default-sha256: 78aeadd906679f0e45a5376f335a102980e01bbff72abb65cb676cc4c1cfcf74
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_067B98EE_A44C_4082_9288_94B79A32DC58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You must be utterly exhausted.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Constantly betrayed, the man you were waiting "
"for never appearing..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vous devez être complètement épuisée.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Constamment trahie, l’homme que vous "
"attendiez n’apparaissant jamais..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_405E2969_551B_4028_B181_8523B24F36F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb0b03e3c7c1c34a84b529a8346ab38f41b7d023940d672352de816159294c0f
#. default-sha256: af892a5efa837aa76062f6a4d5da2fa3e1ba24f18bfa381a40275360bba976c2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_405E2969_551B_4028_B181_8523B24F36F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After so long, your spirit worn down to the bone, you lost any and all awareness of who you "
"even were."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Après si longtemps, votre esprit rongé jusqu’à l’os, vous avez perdu toute conscience de "
"votre propre identité."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7A11065A_99DF_414F_B190_24DA34064DD5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d00a18c000e957d291ad1880c650cc03dc23d2ac5420a60052f004498d3c195b
#. default-sha256: 521bbe34158900235fa6a8551f8a99e6b2cc72ccbde856aeed7c5798afc6d0ea
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7A11065A_99DF_414F_B190_24DA34064DD5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Who were you hoping to find wandering into this illusory mansion, cut off from the real "
"world?"
msgstr ""
